  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Lemon Candle.png|200px|left|Lemon candle]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 72\n |price = 1 to 457\n |time = 2 h 15 min\n |source = {{Infoicon|candlem|bigger|link=Candle Maker}}\n |xp = 55\n |base = 127\n |dia = 5\n |time3 = 1 h 54 min\n}}\n'''Lemon candles''' are [[products]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 72.\n\nLike all [[products]], they are stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making lemon candles'''===\n[[File:Candle Maker.png|150px|left|Candle Maker]]\nLemon candles are made in the [[Candle Maker]].\n\nTo make a lemon candle, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Beeswax.png|75px|Beeswax|link=Beeswax]]\n|[[File:Lemon.png|75px|Lemons|link=Lemon]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x2'''\n|}\nIt takes 2 hours and 15 minutes to make one lemon candle, and 1 hour and 54 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] maker. Each candle gives players 55 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling lemon candles'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside shop]]\n* Lemon candles can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 4,572 {{Infoicon|coin}} for 10 candles.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a lemon candle costs 420 {{Infoicon|coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 2 lemon candles per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Zitronenkerze\n|es = Vela de limón\n|fr = Bougie au Citron\n|it = Candela al limone\n|nl = Citroenkaars\n|no = Sitronlys\n|zh = Lemon Candle\n}}\n[[pt-br:Vela de limão]]\n[[ru:Лимонная свеча]]\n\n[[Category:Candle Maker Products]]\n[[Category:Beeswax Products]]\n[[Category:Lemon Products]]",
